 style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Hi, I\u2019m having my wedding next year. I have around 200 guests.We are planning to give out homemade chocolates as wedding gifts. We want &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.clearpak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Cannon-0931.jpg&#039;&gt;personalized creative packaging&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:14.6667px;background-color:transparent;\"&gt;Please suggest us some vendors who provide packaging solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906589,"PostDate":1445304569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">Hi, I\u2019m having my wedding next year. I have around 200 guests.We are planning to give out homemade chocolates as wedding gifts. We want <a href='http:\/\/www.clearpak.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/03\/Cannon-0931.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>personalized creative packaging<\/a><\/span><span  style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent\">.\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial;font-size:14.6667px;background-color:transparent\">Please suggest us some vendors who provide packaging solutions.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maryrjones007@outlook.com","IpAddress":"209.44.96.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445303335,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285135.jpg?_r=1445318516","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mary007","Id":285135,"Name":"mary007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.184.88.88","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79665,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62627988eb285ddd314a096b1ceba10b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;efavormart.com has favor bags and boxes. I have ordered tulle and organza from them and it was very high quality at a great prices. I have not ordered favor packaging from them, but I have heard good things.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;papermart.com has a ton of cello bag options for great prices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Not sure if you can personalize the packaging on either of these sites. You could get personalized ribbon to tie off bags or boxes, or you could add a personalized sticker or tag.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909680,"PostDate":1453130277,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>efavormart.com has favor bags and boxes. I have ordered tulle and organza from them and it was very high quality at a great prices. I have not ordered favor packaging from them, but I have heard good things.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>papermart.com has a ton of cello bag options for great prices.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Not sure if you can personalize the packaging on either of these sites. You could get personalized ribbon to tie off bags or boxes, or you could add a personalized sticker or tag.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">\u201cWe are tied to the ocean. And when we go back to the sea - whether it is to sail or to watch it - we are going back from whence we came.\" -John F Kennedy<\/span><\/span>","Email":"mhagedon05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.171.182.209","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1310729969,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"MissMeg","Id":242372,"Name":"MissMeg","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79665","Title":"Packing Wedding Favours","LastPostDate":1453130277},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
