eleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8351693375bc0d05c2048483cef851e6","RawContent":"I got mini-maracas for the kids at my reception, from Oriental trading company. They have a beach-sunset theme painted on them and came out to about 1$ each (min order of 12).\n Just figured this would be helpful for non-mexico brides lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":834505,"PostDate":1252443371,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got mini-maracas for the kids at my reception, from Oriental trading company. They have a beach-sunset theme painted on them and came out to about 1$ each (min order of 12).<br \/> Just figured this would be helpful for non-mexico brides lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>10-10-09<\/span><br><span>Beaches Boscobel!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i798.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy268\/michi6114\/DSC_2290-Copy-1-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i798.photobucket.com\/albums\/y...0-Copy-1-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"michi6114@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1240857393,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217091.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"michelle6114","Id":217091,"Name":"michelle6114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":t