039; ones or the mini ones? \n \n \n Slappy,\n My sister got the 8 inch ones for my shower. I ordered the 6 inch ones for my wedding, they are due to arrive this week. I&#039;ll let you know how they look once they arrive (the sombreros too).","Attachments":[],"Id":835431,"PostDate":1252497788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Re: Mexico Favor Idea- Maracas <br \/> <br \/> --------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br \/> <br \/> wow that whole website is great! I love the mini sombrero idea... how were the maracas your sister got the 8'' ones or the mini ones? <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Slappy,<br \/> My sister got the 8 inch ones for my shower. I ordered the 6 inch ones for my wedding, they are due to arrive this week. I'll let you know how they look once they arrive (the sombreros too).\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/\/i847.photobucket.com\/albums\/ab37\/Heart0476\/LogoKimKirk.jpg\">http:\/\/\/i847.photobucket.com\/albums\/...ogoKimKirk.jpg<\/a><span>[\/IMG]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kimberly1shaw@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1234484125,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214862.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"heart0476","Id":214862,"Name":"heart0476","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42182,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44da76d05028813abb9680cff173961a","RawContent":"I just wanted to let you all know that I used amols for my maracas and I called them and ordered the 4 colors of my wedding. They are just like the ones from Mexico!!! They were wonderful to work with... so, I would definitely suggest it!","Attachments":[],"Id":835482,"PostDate":1252501123,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just wanted to let you all know that I used amols for my maracas and I called them and ordered the 4 colors of my wedding. They are just like the ones from Mexico!!! They were wonderful to work with... so, I would definitely suggest it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Soon to be Mrs. Howell<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"olsontco@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1243611107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217915.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":86,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"olsontco","Id":217915,"Name":"olsontco","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,