{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb6c4ad83037bf3e2ff01e12e6a99ade","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These came out soooo great!! I cannot wait to steal some of these ideas for my guests!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590301,"PostDate":1330947735,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These came out soooo great!! I cannot wait to steal some of these ideas for my guests!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caitlin.tracey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.63.76.243","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1328013611,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250779.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Speckles121","Id":250779,"Name":"Speckles121","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22e01219204ce2409f23016eee2a508c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Nice Job!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590309,"PostDate":1330948492,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Nice Job!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>My Planning Thread: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78847\/coconoirs-planning-thread-picture-heavy\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78847\/coconoirs-planning-thread-picture-heavy<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Our Wedding Feature: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/blog\/real-wedding-chanel-derick%E2%80%A8\">http:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/blog\/real-wedding-chanel-derick%E2%80%A8<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"chanel.conley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.78.193.252","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1275103249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228663.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"coconoir1908","Id":228663,"Name":"coconoir1908","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ad0df2ba4a799438ac783ecbefceb74","RawContent":"Thanks, ladies! BDW has done so much for me in my wedding planning. I hope that my templates can be a very tiny way to give back to this site for all it does for destination brides (not that my files are that great, but I hope they can help some folks). If you don&#039;t have enough posts, please become a supporter of BDW! It&#039;s the best $30 you&#039;ll spend on your wedding, I promise!! \n \n \n \n Thanks, Annie, my fellow cruise bride :-) The embarkation wedding and not knowing your venue is frustrating, I know! The pez, shotglasses and guitar picks are all nods to my FI&#039;s favorite things. The mustang soaps are because of how we met (at a car show) and our love of Mustangs. \n \n You couldn&#039;t pay me enough to tear these apart and redo them at this point, so I totally know how he feels! :-) \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]DramaticAnnie[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n WOW! I&#039;m soo impressed! And you&#039;re a Carnival Bride too! I&#039;m getting married on the Carnival Dream on April 28th, and I&#039;ve been on the Liberty - I got engaged on it in 2010! Eeeek :D \n \n I love everything.. I love your bag, I wish I had spotted that one, I have a similar one but its&#039; got navy trim, and I wanted something more closer to turquoise, oh well. I am uber impressed and so envious of your welcome packets with the timeline and everything in them, wow! I am getting married on embarkation day so they told us we won&#039;t even know what time we&#039;re getting married until 2 weeks before the wedding date. \n \n I have put most of my stuff in a &#039;wedding week survival kit&#039; but I really like how you broke yours up into three little kits.. especially the fun stuff like star wars pez, my fiance would love that. But he would hate it if I broke up all of our survival kits now as we spent a lot of time packing them up.. lol.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1590331,"PostDate":1330951702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Thanks, ladies! BDW has done so much for me in my wedding planning. I hope that my templates can be a very tiny way to give back to this site for all it does for destination brides (not that my files are that great, but I hope they can help some folks). If you don't have enough posts, please become a supporter of BDW! It's the best $30 you'll spend on your wedding, I promise!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks, Annie, my fellow cruise bride :-) The embarkation wedding and not knowing your venue is frustrating, I know! The pez, shotglasses and guitar picks are all nods to my FI's favorite things. The mustang soaps are because of how we met (at a car show) and our love of Mustangs.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You couldn't pay me enough to tear these apart and redo them at this point, so I totally know how he feels! :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>DramaticAnnie<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> WOW! I'm soo impressed! And you're a Carnival Bride too! I'm getting married on the Carnival Dream on April 28th, and I've been on the Liberty - I got engaged on it in 2010! Eeeek <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I love everything.. I love your bag, I wish I had spotted that one, I have a similar one but its' got navy trim, and I wanted something more closer to turquoise, oh well. I am uber impressed and so envious of your welcome packets with the timeline and everything in them, wow! I am getting married on embarkation day so they told us we won't even know what time we're getting married until 2 weeks before the wedding date.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have put most of my stuff in a 'wedding week survival kit' but I really like how you broke yours up into three little kits.. especially the fun stuff like star wars pez, my fiance would love that. But he would hate it if I broke up all of our survival kits now as we spent a lot of time packing them up.. lol.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288606566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56a3aad915186e0e80e3f7a1261a5859","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are awesome! I love how you split up the items into the three packages.&amp;nbsp; I am sure that your guests will love them as well.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590346,"PostDate":1330954573,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are awesome! I love how you split up the items into the three packages.\u00a0 I am sure that your guests will love them as well.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260136781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea9add4b69ffcab529e1302a263ff62f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; WOW! I love your bags! Love the \"share your photos\" card idea and everything you included in the bags. Thanks for the price breakdown and all the templates. Your guests are going to LOVE the bags!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590375,"PostDate":1330959593,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> WOW! I love your bags! Love the \"share your photos\" card idea and everything you included in the bags. Thanks for the price breakdown and all the templates. Your guests are going to LOVE the bags!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Hard Rock Punta Cana May 12, 2012<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmontankb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1303572912,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LalaJ","Id":239192,"Name":"LalaJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05988c4a3a8002cf63322a4470c9e830","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; what bags did you use for all the goodies?&amp;nbsp; Ziploc bags?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590444,"PostDate":1330967247,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> what bags did you use for all the goodies?\u00a0 Ziploc bags?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"allison_darby@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1328301248,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250944.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"allycat3630","Id":250944,"Name":"allycat3630","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b1a980a87bc847e3cca4d9c239593da","RawContent":"Yes ma&#039;am, dollar store ziplocs! \n \n The larger bags (Live, Laugh, Love kit) were large treat bags from Michaels that I bought from a BDW bride. The pez dispensers were annoyingly tall :-)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]allycat3630[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n what bags did you use for all the goodies?  Ziploc bags?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1590467,"PostDate":1330970476,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Yes ma'am, dollar store ziplocs!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The larger bags (Live, Laugh, Love kit) were large treat bags from Michaels that I bought from a BDW bride. The pez dispensers were annoyingly tall :-)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>allycat3630<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> what bags did you use for all the goodies?\u00a0 Ziploc bags?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288606566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66214,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb11c1f9bdf13eff079e77fd3900be2d","RawContent":"this is really nice!  Thanks for sharing, it gives me a lot of ideas! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]acireta[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=2][font=arial]I put in a bunch of extras for our parents and bridesmaids.[\/font][\/size] \n \n [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]For my mom and stepdad, MOB hat and totebag and Team Bride shirt for my stepdad (Vistaprint)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747857\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size] \n \n \n [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]For Al\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s mom, Mother of the Groom shirt and Carnival Liberty totebag (Vistaprint)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] \n [size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747859\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size] \n \n \n [size=2][font=arial]Extras for my bridesmaids:[\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Bridesmaids shirts with nicknames on the back (Target, Michaels)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747864\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Flip-flops for wedding day (Old Navy)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Bridesmaids cosmetics bags (Michaels)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Monogrammed jewelry rolls (David\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bridal)[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] [size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747868\/width\/600\/height\/225[\/img][\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size] [list]\n[*][size=2][font=arial][size=2][font=arial]Notebooks and monogrammed post-it notes[\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[\/list] Bridesmaids&#039; stuff all together: \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747871\/width\/600\/height\/237[\/img] \n \n \n Finally ready to start packing the bags! \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747875\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] \n \n \n The Total Package  \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747877\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] \n \n \n [i][size=2][font=arial]Templates and pricing coming up![\/font][\/size][\/i][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1591019,"PostDate":1331049985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> this is really nice!\u00a0 Thanks for sharing, it gives me a lot of ideas!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>acireta<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I put in a bunch of extras for our parents and bridesmaids.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">For my mom and stepdad, MOB hat and totebag and Team Bride shirt for my stepdad (Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00192.JPG\" height=\"393\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747857\/width\/600\/height\/450\" width=\"549\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">For Al\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s mom, Mother of the Groom shirt and Carnival Liberty totebag (Vistaprint)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00193.JPG\" height=\"388\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747859\/width\/600\/height\/450\" width=\"550\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Extras for my bridesmaids:<\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul style=\"list-style-type: circle\"> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Bridesmaids shirts with nicknames on the back (Target, Michaels)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00064.JPG\" height=\"338\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747864\/width\/600\/height\/450\" style=\"width: 438px; height: 299px\" width=\"474\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul style=\"list-style-type: circle\"> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Flip-flops for wedding day (Old Navy)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Bridesmaids cosmetics bags (Michaels)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Monogrammed jewelry rolls (David\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bridal)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"jewelry pouch outer.jpg\" height=\"195\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747868\/width\/600\/height\/225\" width=\"551\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <ul style=\"list-style-type: circle\"> <li> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Notebooks and monogrammed post-it notes<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Bridesmaids' stuff all together:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"bridesmaids packages.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747871\/width\/600\/height\/237\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Finally ready to start packing the bags!<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00328.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747875\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The Total Package\u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00333.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/747877\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <em><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Templates and pricing coming up!<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p> <\/blockquot