{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c693f028a86c1addc5819c7e70ec1791","RawContent":"Thanks brendee2005! I design them myself and can customize by color and style! They make amazing gifts (I know from my own destination wedding last year!) If you have any questions or are interested, please email me at redibychelsea@gmail.com! Also, if you&#039;d like to join my fan page I&#039;m frequently updating it :)  If you&#039;re interested in reading a few recent reviews from brides here on BDWF as well as del Sol, please take a look here! [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/502092\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img]\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]brendee2005[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I love the barefoor jewelry idea![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1496587,"PostDate":1312205785,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks brendee2005! I design them myself and can customize by color and style! They make amazing gifts (I know from my own destination wedding last year!) If you have any questions or are interested, please email me at redibychelsea@gmail.com! Also, if you'd like to join my fan page I'm frequently updating it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0If you're interested in reading a few recent reviews from brides here on BDWF as well as del Sol, please take a look here!\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"colby-violetmermaid5.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/502092\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>brendee2005<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I love the barefoor jewelry idea!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245205537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56f29fb98323b4597613dd58bdfcbffc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks! From what I&#039;ve seen, you really have beautiful jewlery! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1496675,"PostDate":1312211516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks! From what I've seen, you really have beautiful jewlery! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jwed12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1296988223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236433.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":292,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jwed12","Id":236433,"Name":"Jwed12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ba4919fde5ac68bdffaef30fa6c7b5b","RawContent":"Thanks so much :)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Jwed12[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks! From what I&#039;ve seen, you really have beautiful jewlery! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1496695,"PostDate":1312214078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks so much <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Jwed12<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks! From what I've seen, you really have beautiful jewlery! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245205537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22c2848de2457eb0316c29c2c83dcb76","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am struggling with this! I think I&#039;m going to do a horseback excursion for my BM&#039;s, an OOT bag with a few extra goodies, and a necklace. I found these 2 on Etsy and I can&#039;t decide between them:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Seller is Kookime.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Screen shot 2011-08-04 at 7.37.36 PM.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/505742\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Screen shot 2011-08-04 at 7.37.46 PM.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/505745\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499501,"PostDate":1312494326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am struggling with this! I think I'm going to do a horseback excursion for my BM's, an OOT bag with a few extra goodies, and a necklace. I found these 2 on Etsy and I can't decide between them:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Seller is Kookime.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Screen shot 2011-08-04 at 7.37.36 PM.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/505742\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Screen shot 2011-08-04 at 7.37.46 PM.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/505745\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Brad & Janine - November 10th, 2011.<\/span><br><span>Valentin Imperial Maya, Riviera Maya<\/span><br><span>Bride & Groom + 29<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"janine_bolton@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1282590738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231642.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JBean","Id":231642,"Name":"JBean","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5fd535ff2450aa907c881ce74f440400","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow! They are both really cute, but I think I like the bow one better. It makes more of a statement, and it&#039;s flirty and fun. Great find! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499736,"PostDate":1312530309,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow! They are both really cute, but I think I like the bow one better. It makes more of a statement, and it's flirty and fun. Great find! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jwed12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1296988223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236433.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":292,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jwed12","Id":236433,"Name":"Jwed12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1974e25274698ad3d1cf197ab8e84c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are doing necklaces, earrings, tan extender from Victorias Secret, personalized beachchair covers, junior bridesmaid and flower girl are getting a swimsuit also. But I need something else for my MOH can&#039;t figure that one out yet :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499737,"PostDate":1312530702,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are doing necklaces, earrings, tan extender from Victorias Secret, personalized beachchair covers, junior bridesmaid and flower girl are getting a swimsuit also. But I need something else for my MOH can't figure that one out yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sllefebvr@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.223.108.246","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1298503181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237131.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sllefebvr","Id":237131,"Name":"Sllefebvr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77cae59ed7c336dac86e28f28ee6e184","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; For anyone who&#039;s interested, the Knot has some really good sales if you sign up there. I got each of my bridesmaids a different colored canvas beach bag with their monogram on it for 7 bucks a peice. Right now they&#039;re having a great sale on jewlery and personalized cuff links for guys.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1500450,"PostDate":1312653249,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> For anyone who's interested, the Knot has some really good sales if you sign up there. I got each of my bridesmaids a different colored canvas beach bag with their monogram on it for 7 bucks a peice. Right now they're having a great sale on jewlery and personalized cuff links for guys.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jwed12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1296988223,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236433.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":292,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jwed12","Id":236433,"Name":"Jwed12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"951686826a69ce80c6327c2a3552b41d","RawContent":"Hey Sllefebvr! If you&#039;re looking for something special for your MOH, have you considered custom jewelry? I designed each one of my bridesmaids\/MOH their own pieces to make it as unique of an experience as their own personalities. Another thing I did to personalize the experience, was I added handwritten notes inside of each jewelry box that included memories that we had together :) If you need any inspiration, here is my site :) [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508295\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508297\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508299\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img]\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Sllefebvr[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are doing necklaces, earrings, tan extender from Victorias Secret, personalized beachchair covers, junior bridesmaid and flower girl are getting a swimsuit also. But I need something else for my MOH can&#039;t figure that one out yet :([\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1500838,"PostDate":1312759799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Sllefebvr! If you're looking for something special for your MOH, have you considered custom jewelry? I designed each one of my bridesmaids\/MOH their own pieces to make it as unique of an experience as their own personalities. Another thing I did to personalize the experience, was I added handwritten notes inside of each jewelry box that included memories that we had together <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> If you need any inspiration, here is my site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0018.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508295\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0137.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508297\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0333.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508299\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Sllefebvr<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are doing necklaces, earrings, tan extender from Victorias Secret, personalized beachchair covers, junior bridesmaid and flower girl are getting a swimsuit also. But I need something else for my MOH can't figure that one out yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245205537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d02d6b20b0ee3123a4a887b3bc310603","RawContent":"I apologize, I just read that you said you were already doing necklaces &amp;amp; earrings...so the barefoot jewelry would be my suggestion! Tired eyes - sheesh!! :)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]bondgirl0072010[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey Sllefebvr! If you&#039;re looking for something special for your MOH, have you considered custom jewelry? I designed each one of my bridesmaids\/MOH their own pieces to make it as unique of an experience as their own personalities. Another thing I did to personalize the experience, was I added handwritten notes inside of each jewelry box that included memories that we had together :) If you need any inspiration, here is my site :) [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508295\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508297\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508299\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img]\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1500839,"PostDate":1312759854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I apologize, I just read that you said you were already doing necklaces & earrings...so the barefoot jewelry would be my suggestion! Tired eyes - sheesh!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>bondgirl0072010<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey Sllefebvr! If you're looking for something special for your MOH, have you considered custom jewelry? I designed each one of my bridesmaids\/MOH their own pieces to make it as unique of an experience as their own personalities. Another thing I did to personalize the experience, was I added handwritten notes inside of each jewelry box that included memories that we had together <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> If you need any inspiration, here is my site <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0018.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508295\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0137.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508297\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Chelsea+Eric_W_0333.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/508299\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245205537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"995981af890ef4a42ff42efa902cff8c","RawContent":"wow that is awesome!!! i could never afford that! but that is truely awesome that you are doing that! i am buying personalized wine glasses from etsy! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JayKay[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are paying for their dresses, hair, jewelry and makeup, so we are only going for small gifts.  I got them passport covers off etsy and flip cameras.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1500875,"PostDate":1312766455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> wow that is awesome!!! i could never afford that! but that is truely awesome that you are doing that! i am buying personalized wine glasses from etsy!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JayKay<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are paying for their dresses, hair, jewelry and makeup, so we are only going for small gifts.\u00a0 I got them passport covers off etsy and flip cameras.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>All because, two people fell in love!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenniebootles@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"141.106.82.66","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309396394,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241781.jpg?_r=1424182685","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Gin Bootles","Id":241781,"Name":"Gin Bootles","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":74,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}